{"event":"token","data":{"seq":27,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"1024 维向量之间没有「大小」这种全序关系"}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":28,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"，只有距离。没有全序，就没有可以二分的东西，"}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":29,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"B+ 树的结构直接失效。[2]\n"}}
