{"event":"citation","data":{"seq":31,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"claim_id":3,"marker":"[3]","chunk_ids":["c_148"],"quote":"HNSW 构建多层可导航小世界图，上层稀疏用于快速跳转，下层稠密用于精确收敛，查询自顶向下贪心搜索。","source":{"doc_id":12,"doc_name":"HNSW 原论文摘录","heading_path":"3. 分层图结构"}}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":32,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"这就是为什么向量检索必须用 ANN 近似最近"}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":33,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"邻索引。HNSW 把向量组织成一张多层图："}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":34,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"上层稀疏、跨度大，负责快速跳到目标区域；"}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":35,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"下层稠密、精度高，负责局部收敛。"}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":36,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"查询时从顶层贪心下降，用一点召回率换几个数量"}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":37,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"级的加速。[3]\n\n"}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":38,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"所以两者不是「谁更快」的关系，"}}
{"event":"token","data":{"seq":39,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577769,"text":"而是解决不同问题的两种结构："}}
