{"event":"citation","data":{"seq":42,"trace_id":"t_mock01","ts":1792737577770,"claim_id":5,"marker":"[5]","chunk_ids":["c_205"],"quote":"提升 RAG 召回质量的三个主要手段：混合检索（向量+关键词 RRF 融合）、重排序（cross-encoder）、以及父子块切片策略。","source":{"doc_id":15,"doc_name":"LlamaIndex · Production RAG","heading_path":"优化 > 检索质量"}}}
